{"id":"distante","lemma":"distante","pos":"adj","rank":4448,"glosses":["distant (space or time)","detached, aloof, standoffish"],"ipa":"/disˈtante/","forms":{"femininePlural":"distantes"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom estaba distante.","en":"Tom was aloof.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800155","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]},{"text":"Mary es una persona cálida y bondadosa, pero Tom es frío y distante.","en":"Mary is a warm, caring person, but Tom is cold and aloof.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"person (an individual"},{"g":"warm","l":"cálido"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"kind","l":"bondadoso"},{"g":"but"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"cold"},{"g":"and"},null]},{"text":"Los gatos son distantes, las cobayas son nerviosas y los perros necesitan cariño constante y atención.","en":"Cats are aloof, guinea pigs are nervous, and dogs need constant love and attention.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"cat","l":"gato"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"nerve","l":"nervioso"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"dog","l":"perro"},{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"affection, fondness"},{"g":"constant"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"attention"}]}]}